[2026-03-14T22:16:54.661Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YLiWbMzcKSgkkX7AbPkpSd","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile the findings:\n\n## Summary: LinearClone Data-TestIDs and API Response Formats\n\nBased on my comprehensive search through the `/repo/apps/LinearClone` codebase, here are the exact data-testid values and component structures you requested:\n\n### 1. Issue Detail Page - Activity/History Section\n\n**Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ActivityComments.tsx`\n\nData-TestID values:\n- `activity-comments` - Main container\n- `activity-comments-tabs` - Tabs container\n- `activity-tab` - Activity tab button\n- `comments-tab` - Comments tab button\n- `activity-comments-content` - Content wrapper\n- `activity-list` - Activity list container\n- `activity-entry-{id}` - Individual activity entry (dynamic, with entry ID)\n- `activity-empty` - Empty state message\n- `comments-list` - Comments list container\n- `comment-entry-{id}` - Individual comment entry (dynamic, with comment ID)\n- `comment-content-{id}` - Comment content area (dynamic, with comment ID)\n- `comments-empty` - Empty comments message\n- `comment-input-section` - Comment input wrapper\n- `comment-input` - Comment textarea\n- `comment-submit-btn` - Submit comment button\n\n**Activity/Comment Object Structures** (from `issueDetailSlice.ts`):\n\nActivity Entry:\n```typescript\ninterface ActivityEntry {\n  id: string;\n  action: string;\n  createdAt: string;\n  memberId: string;\n  memberName: string | null;\n  memberEmail: string | null;\n}\n```\n\nComment:\n```typescript\ninterface Comment {\n  id: string;\n  content: string;\n  createdAt: string;\n  memberId: string;\n  memberName: string | null;\n  memberEmail: string | null;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Issue Detail Page - Sub-Issues Section\n\n**Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SubIssues.tsx`\n\nData-TestID values:\n- `sub-issues` - Main container\n- `sub-issues-title` - \"Sub-issues\" heading\n- `sub-issues-add-btn` - \"Add sub-issue\" button\n- `sub-issues-list` - List container\n- `sub-issues-empty` - Empty state message\n- `sub-issue-row-{id}` - Individual sub-issue row (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n- `sub-issue-status-{id}` - Status icon (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n- `sub-issue-priority-{id}` - Priority icon (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n- `sub-issue-identifier-{id}` - Issue identifier (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n- `sub-issue-title-{id}` - Sub-issue title/button (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n\n**SubIssue Object Structure**:\n```typescript\ninterface SubIssue {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  status: string;\n  priority: string;\n  identifier: string;\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Inbox/Notifications Page\n\n**Component Page**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Inbox.tsx`\n**Components**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationList.tsx` and `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationRow.tsx`\n\nData-TestID values:\n- `inbox-page` - Main inbox page container\n- `inbox-title` - \"Inbox\" title heading\n- `inbox-title-count` - Unread count badge (e.g., \"(3)\")\n- `notification-list` - Notifications list container\n- `notification-list-header` - List header\n- `notification-list-title` - Title text in header\n- `notification-list-count` - Count in list header\n- `notification-list-loading` - Loading state message\n- `notification-list-empty` - Empty state (shows \"You're all caught up!\")\n- `notification-list-items` - Items container\n- `notification-row-{id}` - Individual notification row (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-row-unread` - CSS class for unread rows (in addition to data-testid)\n- `notification-icon-{id}` - Notification type icon (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-identifier-{id}` - Issue identifier (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-description-{id}` - Notification description (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-timestamp-{id}` - Relative timestamp (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-archive-btn-{id}` - Archive button (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `sidebar-inbox-badge` - Sidebar unread count badge (in Sidebar component)\n\n**Notification Object Structure**:\n```typescript\ninterface Notification {\n  id: string;\n  type: 'assignment' | 'update' | 'mention';\n  issue_id: string;\n  description: string;\n  read: boolean;\n  archived: boolean;\n  created_at: string;\n  issue_identifier: string;\n  issue_title: string;\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Team-Issues API Response Format\n\n**API Endpoint**: `/api/team-issues?teamId={teamId}` (GET)\n\n**Response Structure**:\n```typescript\n{\n  issues: TeamIssue[];\n  members: TeamMember[];\n  projects: TeamProject[];\n  cycles: TeamCycle[];\n}\n```\n\n**Cycles Array Structure** (from `teamIssuesSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\ninterface TeamCycle {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  start_date: string;      // ISO date string\n  end_date: string;        // ISO date string\n}\n\n// In issueDetailSlice.ts, the same structure applies:\ninterface TeamCycle {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  start_date: string;\n  end_date: string;\n}\n```\n\nThe cycles array is populated when fetching team issues and used in the IssueSidebar for cycle selection via dropdown.\n\n### 5. Notifications API Endpoint\n\n**Primary Notification Endpoints**:\n\n1. **Fetch all notifications**:\n   - Endpoint: `/api/notifications` (GET)\n   - Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n   - Response: `{ notifications: Notification[] }`\n\n2. **Get unread count**:\n   - Endpoint: `/api/notifications-count` (GET)\n   - Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n   - Response: `{ count: number }`\n\n3. **Mark notification as read**:\n   - Endpoint: `/api/notifications/{notificationId}/read` (PUT)\n   - Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n\n4. **Archive notification**:\n   - Endpoint: `/api/notifications/{notificationId}/archive` (PUT)\n   - Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n\nAll notification data is fetched via the `fetchNotifications` thunk from `notificationsSlice.ts` (line 44-59).\n\n---\n\n**File Locations**:\n- Activity/Comments: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ActivityComments.tsx`\n- Sub-Issues: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SubIssues.tsx`\n- Notifications: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Inbox.tsx`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationList.tsx`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationRow.tsx`\n- Type Definitions: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/issueDetailSlice.ts`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamIssuesSlice.ts`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/notificationsSlice.ts`\n- Tests: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/issue-detail-activity-comments.spec.ts`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/issue-detail-sub-issues.spec.ts`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/inbox-list.spec.ts`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a449c9dd8427bc051 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 61881\ntool_uses: 27\nduration_ms: 35507</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1c91b507-8d26-43b3-bb1c-ff396945621b","uuid":"19191383-36c1-4269-b185-f23e769f76b9","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/LinearClone, find the data-testid values used for:\n1. Issue detail page - activity/history section (look for activity-related testids)\n2. Issue detail page - sub-issues section (look for sub-issue testids)\n3. The inbox/notifications page (look for notification-related testids)\n4. The team-issues API response format (what does the cycles array look like in the response?)\n5. The notifications API endpoint\n\nSearch for these patterns in the source code and return the exact data-testid values and component structures.","agentId":"a449c9dd8427bc051","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile the findings:\n\n## Summary: LinearClone Data-TestIDs and API Response Formats\n\nBased on my comprehensive search through the `/repo/apps/LinearClone` codebase, here are the exact data-testid values and component structures you requested:\n\n### 1. Issue Detail Page - Activity/History Section\n\n**Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ActivityComments.tsx`\n\nData-TestID values:\n- `activity-comments` - Main container\n- `activity-comments-tabs` - Tabs container\n- `activity-tab` - Activity tab button\n- `comments-tab` - Comments tab button\n- `activity-comments-content` - Content wrapper\n- `activity-list` - Activity list container\n- `activity-entry-{id}` - Individual activity entry (dynamic, with entry ID)\n- `activity-empty` - Empty state message\n- `comments-list` - Comments list container\n- `comment-entry-{id}` - Individual comment entry (dynamic, with comment ID)\n- `comment-content-{id}` - Comment content area (dynamic, with comment ID)\n- `comments-empty` - Empty comments message\n- `comment-input-section` - Comment input wrapper\n- `comment-input` - Comment textarea\n- `comment-submit-btn` - Submit comment button\n\n**Activity/Comment Object Structures** (from `issueDetailSlice.ts`):\n\nActivity Entry:\n```typescript\ninterface ActivityEntry {\n  id: string;\n  action: string;\n  createdAt: string;\n  memberId: string;\n  memberName: string | null;\n  memberEmail: string | null;\n}\n```\n\nComment:\n```typescript\ninterface Comment {\n  id: string;\n  content: string;\n  createdAt: string;\n  memberId: string;\n  memberName: string | null;\n  memberEmail: string | null;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Issue Detail Page - Sub-Issues Section\n\n**Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SubIssues.tsx`\n\nData-TestID values:\n- `sub-issues` - Main container\n- `sub-issues-title` - \"Sub-issues\" heading\n- `sub-issues-add-btn` - \"Add sub-issue\" button\n- `sub-issues-list` - List container\n- `sub-issues-empty` - Empty state message\n- `sub-issue-row-{id}` - Individual sub-issue row (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n- `sub-issue-status-{id}` - Status icon (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n- `sub-issue-priority-{id}` - Priority icon (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n- `sub-issue-identifier-{id}` - Issue identifier (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n- `sub-issue-title-{id}` - Sub-issue title/button (dynamic, with sub-issue ID)\n\n**SubIssue Object Structure**:\n```typescript\ninterface SubIssue {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  status: string;\n  priority: string;\n  identifier: string;\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Inbox/Notifications Page\n\n**Component Page**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Inbox.tsx`\n**Components**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationList.tsx` and `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationRow.tsx`\n\nData-TestID values:\n- `inbox-page` - Main inbox page container\n- `inbox-title` - \"Inbox\" title heading\n- `inbox-title-count` - Unread count badge (e.g., \"(3)\")\n- `notification-list` - Notifications list container\n- `notification-list-header` - List header\n- `notification-list-title` - Title text in header\n- `notification-list-count` - Count in list header\n- `notification-list-loading` - Loading state message\n- `notification-list-empty` - Empty state (shows \"You're all caught up!\")\n- `notification-list-items` - Items container\n- `notification-row-{id}` - Individual notification row (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-row-unread` - CSS class for unread rows (in addition to data-testid)\n- `notification-icon-{id}` - Notification type icon (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-identifier-{id}` - Issue identifier (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-description-{id}` - Notification description (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-timestamp-{id}` - Relative timestamp (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `notification-archive-btn-{id}` - Archive button (dynamic, with notification ID)\n- `sidebar-inbox-badge` - Sidebar unread count badge (in Sidebar component)\n\n**Notification Object Structure**:\n```typescript\ninterface Notification {\n  id: string;\n  type: 'assignment' | 'update' | 'mention';\n  issue_id: string;\n  description: string;\n  read: boolean;\n  archived: boolean;\n  created_at: string;\n  issue_identifier: string;\n  issue_title: string;\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Team-Issues API Response Format\n\n**API Endpoint**: `/api/team-issues?teamId={teamId}` (GET)\n\n**Response Structure**:\n```typescript\n{\n  issues: TeamIssue[];\n  members: TeamMember[];\n  projects: TeamProject[];\n  cycles: TeamCycle[];\n}\n```\n\n**Cycles Array Structure** (from `teamIssuesSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\ninterface TeamCycle {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  start_date: string;      // ISO date string\n  end_date: string;        // ISO date string\n}\n\n// In issueDetailSlice.ts, the same structure applies:\ninterface TeamCycle {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  start_date: string;\n  end_date: string;\n}\n```\n\nThe cycles array is populated when fetching team issues and used in the IssueSidebar for cycle selection via dropdown.\n\n### 5. Notifications API Endpoint\n\n**Primary Notification Endpoints**:\n\n1. **Fetch all notifications**:\n   - Endpoint: `/api/notifications` (GET)\n   - Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n   - Response: `{ notifications: Notification[] }`\n\n2. **Get unread count**:\n   - Endpoint: `/api/notifications-count` (GET)\n   - Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n   - Response: `{ count: number }`\n\n3. **Mark notification as read**:\n   - Endpoint: `/api/notifications/{notificationId}/read` (PUT)\n   - Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n\n4. **Archive notification**:\n   - Endpoint: `/api/notifications/{notificationId}/archive` (PUT)\n   - Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n\nAll notification data is fetched via the `fetchNotifications` thunk from `notificationsSlice.ts` (line 44-59).\n\n---\n\n**File Locations**:\n- Activity/Comments: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/ActivityComments.tsx`\n- Sub-Issues: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SubIssues.tsx`\n- Notifications: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Inbox.tsx`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationList.tsx`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationRow.tsx`\n- Type Definitions: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/issueDetailSlice.ts`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamIssuesSlice.ts`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/notificationsSlice.ts`\n- Tests: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/issue-detail-activity-comments.spec.ts`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/issue-detail-sub-issues.spec.ts`, `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/inbox-list.spec.ts`"}],"totalDurationMs":35507,"totalTokens":61881,"totalToolUseCount":27,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3706,"cache_read_input_tokens":56183,"output_tokens":1992,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3706},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
